  "abstract": "This is the definitive, for-scoring version of the \"Surgical Synthesis\" hypothesis. The model architecture was successfully validated in a previous unit test (ID 235). This submission removes the test() function to enable a full training run and evaluation. The model augments the input to the SOTA architecture with a spatial context vector generated by a 1D CNN, aiming to prove that this computationally efficient synthesis can achieve a new SOTA score.",
